meta {
  name: billing — private function still requires a JWT
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{supabase_url}}/functions/v1/billing
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 401
}

docs {
  The inverse direction, and it must fail closed too.

  `billing` carries ZERO self-authentication — no apiKey, no signature check — so it relies entirely
  on the gateway JWT and is deliberately NOT listed under verify_jwt = false. If this ever returns
  200 or 400, gateway auth was switched off for a function that has no other guard, which is an
  exposure rather than an outage.
}
